// onjo_m1.wac
// The rain and its overcast from the mission's start, written as the original's rainy missions
// write theirs (TKP_C2A, ASB_G11A): the first execution, at the start, sets both targets and the
// start's weather settle brings them in before play.
if never() then
	rain(100,1)
	overcast(50,1)
endif
